, 283825, 283792, 283791, 283786, 283785, 283783, 283782, 283781, 283780, 283778, 283777, 283763, 283737, 283734, 283733, 283694, 283669, 283668, 283667, 283666, 283665, 283661, 283660, 283657, 283655, 283654, 283652, 283634, 283626, 283625, 283624, 283612, 283610, 283608, 283599, 283587, 283570, 283501, 283483, 283482, 283470, 283441, 283425, 283422, 283421, 283420, 282449, 282446, 282434, 282068, 282066, 282064, 282061, 282008, 281871, 281530, 281528, 281198, 281197, 281196, 281195, 281185, 281184, 281183, 281182, 281176, 281175, 281174, 281173, 281172, 280573, 280572, 280395, 280393, 280365, 280336, 280261, 280174, 280159, 280158, 280156, 280155, 280154, 280151, 280140, 280121, 280120, 280119, 280118, 280003, 279998, 279978, 279976, 279893, 279885, 279867, 279866, 279539, 279538, 279533, 279474, 279472, 279166, 279165, 279133, 279132, 279130, 279128, 279122, 279101, 279096, 279093, 279092, 278986, 278984, 278979, 278863, 278862, 278816, 278763, 278689, 278688, 278673, 278672, 278655, 278654, 278601, 278600, 278596, 278594, 278592, 278591, 278590, 278589, 278474, 278454, 278442, 278439, 278436, 278330, 278328, 278326, 278312, 278311, 278310, 278306, 278288, 278284, 278283, 278224, 278222, 278219, 278216, 278213, 278212, 278209, 278208, 278205, 278203, 278201, 278121, 278119, 278099, 278070, 277996, 277821, 277819, 277635, 277633, 277631, 277572, 277571, 277569, 277568, 277560, 277559, 277541, 277540, 277522, 277515, 277514, 277476, 276933, 276932, 276931, 276930, 276926, 275346, 275261, 274741, 274740, 266766);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `VoiceOverPriorityID`, `SoundKitID1`, `SoundKitID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Do you need something?', '', 302025, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The smug aura of the statue seems to mock your Earthen ancestry. <Destroy it.>', 'The smug aura of the statue seems to mock your Earthen ancestry. <Destroy it.>', 301630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I... I see. Thank you, $p, for imparting this wisdom with me.\n\nI must take some time to consider this.\n\nGo, learn what else you can while this timeline remains stable.', 301175, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Of that, I am sure. Thank you $p for these insights. We will continue to watch your progress together.', 301174, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Give it time, $p. Much more we will learn in time.', 301173, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Ah yes, those. My studies suggest they come from a timeline in which you are revered as a god for your infinite power and capabilities.\n\nPerhaps this timeline is not too far away from that.', 300958, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My business is my own. Leave me to it.', '', 300954, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The less you know, the better.', '', 300953, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Too easy.', 'Too easy.', 299848, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 262144, 3511746560, 3511746560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I am late. So very very late.\n\nI am afraid I am not open yet. I am so terribly sorry.\n\nPerhaps I should get a clock.', '', 299752, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'If you insist. You have been warned.', 299624, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Lady Alleria is relying on us to work with the K\'areshi to secure access to Manaforge Omega.\n\nBrokers. Ethereals. Ren\'dorei. We will do what we can to buy you time.\n\nGo now! Do what must be done, $n.', '', 299408, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Out of assignments for the day, huh? Come back tomorrow, I\'m sure we\'ll have something else for you.', 299342, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ach. Tha beasties are fine. Looks like you\'ve got yerself a helper there. What\'s yar name, friend?', '', 299131, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Hello Hemet. How are the animals today?', 299128, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ok.', '', 299126, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Pythagorus, I want to introduce you to $p. They are a friend, so no smashing. Ok?', 299124, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You are too kind, Moratari, but all these clothes don\'t fold themselves.', 299122, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'This is our fashion historian, Larah. She probably has the best job here.', 299120, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'This one is not for collecting, Horos. $p is assisting us in our research.', 299113, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Well, well, well. What have you brought me this time, Moratari?', '', 299111, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Allow me to introduce Horos. A collector of rare things.', 299109, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('On that note, Moratari, I have some data points for you, but they can wait. Good to see you again, $p.', '', 299108, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'m awake! I\'m awake.', '', 299102, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 449, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The Nesingwary bloodline runs deeper and longer than the mightiest river, and is possessing of a fearsome, almost preternatural ability to identify beasts great and small purely by the scent of thar droppings carried on the faintest o\' winds.\n\nWhen Eternus asked if I wanted to travel to the distant past to hunt the same critters as me ancestors, I couldn\'t pass up the chance.\n\nAll I gotta do is keep an eye on these beasties and make sure they don\'t get in the rubbish.', '', 298857, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 1, 6, 0, 0, 63796),
('The name\'s Hemet Nesingwary, tha seventeenth.\n\nSurely you\'ve \'eard of my esteemed and grand familial lineage.', '', 298855, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('A treasure to meet you, $p.\n\nEternus has tasked me with collecting rare things and creatures across time.\n\nPurely for study, of course.\n\nBut not to worry. As rare and as intriguing as you may be, it would be immoral to collect a sentient being such as yourself.', '', 298852, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 1, 0, 0, 63796),
('Hello, little $r.\n\nI\'m here to make sure the little ones don\'t get into trouble they can\'t get out of.\n\nBut sometimes little ones get into trouble in places I can\'t fit, or when I\'m not around. So I sell them nice shiny weapons and armor for when I\'m not there.\n\nThen later I go beat up whoever needs beating up. Sometimes I bring Erus. He\'s always in the mood for a good scrap.', '', 298850, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 66, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Fashion is as much a reflection of the times as anything. My job in the Infinite is to keep my finger on the pulse of what people are wearing and why.\n\nAfter all, if you want to do good, you\'ve got to look good.', 298847, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 1, 6, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So that was Xal\'atath?\n\nAlleria is a fool to reject her. I would be transcendent if Xal\'atath recognized my potential.\n\nConsider yourself lucky, $c. Some of us would not mind her whispers.', 297411, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'What are you waiting for? Each breath that king takes is one too many.', 297037, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You again. I had quite a fun time with you and that silly dwarf.', 297036, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Help? Aren\'t you just adorable. I don\'t need help from you pathetic corporeals.\n\nSince you seem so eager, I\'ll allow it. However, I can\'t guarantee that I won\'t cause you any... collateral damage.', 297034, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'An enticing bounty has been placed on the Nexus-King\'s head, and I intend to take it. Sounds like I will have to take yours too, if you don\'t turn around now.', 297032, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You intrude on my work.', 297030, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Need something? I\'ve got theories to sort through.', 295603, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Day in, day out, count count count.', 295601, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Merciless K\'aresh tests us. He tests you as well by taking the object you desire. Not to worry, I will acquire your reward once more, in due time.', '', 294790, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Some trinkets linger, but most are swept away when the Veil shift\'s anew.', '', 294787, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The Infinite Armoredon regards you with mild interest.>', '', 294351, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Forgeweaver Araz sacrificed himself to his machines, overloading Manaforge Omega with his energy. His conviction to succeed at any cost means that Dimensius\'s rebirth is now inevitable.\n\nMove out into the wastes and find an alternate entrance to the Manaforge\'s core. Meanwhile, Locus-Walker and I will stabilize the Manaforge and delay Dimensius\'s revival until you arrive.', 294335, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Forgeweaver Araz\'s death overloaded the Manaforge with an enormous surge of power, locking down most of the facility.\n\nMove out into the wastes and find an alternate entrance to the Manaforge\'s core. Meanwhile, Xal\'atath and I will try to stabilize the Manaforge and delay Dimensius\'s rebirth until you arrive.', '', 294334, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Forgeweaver Araz\'s death overloaded the Manaforge with an enormous surge of power, locking down most of the facility.\n\nMove out into the wastes and find an alternate entrance to the Manaforge\'s core. I will gather my forces and meet you once I\'ve done so.', 294333, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Keep your shield up, and patience will see you through any battle.', '', 294288, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Oh, a time walker! I bet you\'ve got stories to tell.', 294237, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Maybe ye should go ahead, though. I\'m not exactly at my most presentable.', '', 294134, 0, 0, 24, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Erus scrap junk for you.', '', 294077, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'To answer that, you would have to experience it for yourself. Fortunately, infinite magic makes this possible.\n\nI can conjure a copy of the message sent to champions like yourself, if you wish.', 294026, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will just record those data points and you. Are. Free. To. Go.\n\nThank you, $p. Your insights are inspiring and noteworthy.', 293878, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 2, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Each Order Hall holds its own ideals, cultivates its own identity, and takes pride in standing apart from the others.\n\nTell me, $p, what does your Order Hall mean to you?', 293841, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Hmph.', 293593, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('R.I.P.\n\nHere lies $xgn, $xgc.\n\nThey perished at $xgt on $xgd.', 'R.I.P.\n\nHere lies $xgn, $xgc.\n\nThey perished at $xgt on $xgd.', 293576, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We are never alone so long as we stand together.', '', 293302, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<It may be possible to send a Flow Surge into the chamber beyond with this device, harming the enemies within. However, you don\'t yet possess the expertise to do so.>', '<It may be possible to send a Flow Surge into the chamber beyond with this device, harming the enemies within. However, you don\'t yet possess the expertise to do so.>', 293237, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<A Flow Surge was already sent elsewhere within Manaforge Omega, harming the enemy forces found there. You lack the expertise to send another Flow Surge into the chamber beyond, but perhaps someone else understands how to do so.>', '<A Flow Surge was already sent elsewhere within Manaforge Omega, harming the enemy forces found there. You lack the expertise to send another Flow Surge into the chamber beyond, but perhaps someone else understands how to do so.>', 293236, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<This console is offline. It was previously used to send a Flow Surge into the chamber beyond, harming the enemy forces within.>', '<This console is offline. It was previously used to send a Flow Surge into the chamber beyond, harming the enemy forces within.>', 293235, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<This device controls energy flow within Manaforge Omega. You\'ve gained enough understanding to send a Flow Surge into the chamber beyond, harming the enemies within.>', '<This device controls energy flow within Manaforge Omega. You\'ve gained enough understanding to send a Flow Surge into the chamber beyond, harming the enemies within.>', 293210, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Never settle for the unknown.', 293052, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963196416, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The possibilities are infinite.', 293051, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963130880, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Observe all that surrounds you.', 293050, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963065344, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Our endeavor goes on.', 293049, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1962999808, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So much knowledge, waiting to be gleaned.', 293048, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963458560, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'What is history, if not a series of variables?', 293047, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963393024, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Who knows what knowledge we\'ll acquire?', 293046, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963327488, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It\'s a pleasure to work with you.', 293045, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 0, 1963261952, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ll be waiting.', '', 293044, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1963982848, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Come back if anything breaks.', '', 293043, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1963917312, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Go put your gear to the test.', '', 293042, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1963851776, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('See you soon.', '', 293041, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1963786240, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('There\'s always something to be fixed.', '', 293040, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1964244992, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Give me something to build.', '', 293039, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1964179456, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Nothing like a hot forge and a good hammer!', '', 293038, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1964113920, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('In need of repairs?', '', 293037, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 131072, 1964048384, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The Forge Core\'s traversal node fails to respond. It would appear that Forgeweaver Araz\'s actions damaged it.>', '<The Forge Core\'s traversal node fails to respond. It would appear that Forgeweaver Araz\'s actions damaged it.>', 292999, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You think I care if you trust me?\n\nOh, $n. You understand me so little.\n\nYou don\'t need to trust me. I don\'t need to trust you. All I \"trust\" is that you know I\'m the only force that can keep everyone you know and care about from being destroyed.\n\nNow that we have an understanding, I would suggest accepting my help with gratitude.', 292995, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If we fail to stop Dimensius, the entire cosmos will share K\'aresh\'s fate. We must succeed at any cost.', '', 292994, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I don\'t trust Xal\'atath, and I never will. But, as much as I wish it weren\'t so, we need her assistance to stop Dimensius.', 292993, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If you were to retrieve it, Erus would scrap it for the materials we used in its creation.', '', 292960, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1971453952, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'If you\'re all set, let\'s get you back to Dalaran so you can rejoin the flow of events. You\'re always welcome back here, though!', 292931, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1958739968, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Get acquainted with the rest of our temporal excursion. I am excited to see what differences you have yet to make.', 292926, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1958608896, 4, 603, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Our goal with this experiment is to see how history would have played out if some of the variables were changed.', 292925, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1958543360, 4, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It seems you\'ve already had quite the impact on this timeline, $p. But our work here has just begun.', 292924, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1958019072, 4, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'As exciting as all that was, I\'ll be glad to get back to the Infinite Bazaar. Eternus will surely want to speak with you, too.', 292923, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1957953536, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Now that you have your artifact, it\'s time to be the hero you\'re meant to be. Report to Khadgar and save the day!', '', 292920, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1957560320, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Take that new artifact for a spin! Defeating enemies will provide temporal energy to further empower it, and armor for Erus to scrap.', '', 292919, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1957494784, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ah, you\'re back! Now to forge some infinite bronze from what you\'ve collected.', '', 292918, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956970496, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I can pluck one from its current time and place for you, but I\'ll need a few reagents to cast the spell.', '', 292915, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956708352, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If you\'re going to play the hero, then you\'ll need a powerful artifact weapon from this timeline.', '', 292914, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956642816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If we don\'t reinforce the buildings\' barriers, then the civilians hiding inside will be left defenseless.', '', 292912, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956380672, 4, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I don\'t know what went wrong, or how the Legion was able to breach our defenses, but we must retake the city.', '', 292911, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1956315136, 4, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The spell we cast was supposed to banish the Legion\'s forces from Dalaran before it was teleported to the Broken Isles.', '', 292910, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1956249600, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The civilians are taking refuge in their homes and the Council has gathered at the city\'s center. Clear a path to us!', '', 292909, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956118528, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Very well. I\'ll see what I can do for future research assignments. Anything else?', 292639, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'What did you have in mind?', 292629, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Find and defeat these creatures to claim the temporal energy coursing through them. But know that you will be in for a challenge.', 292535, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1968832512, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You are now in an altered timeline where I have greatly empowered some of the creatures you will encounter.', 292534, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1968766976, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We must act boldly with the time that remains. Reward seldom comes without risk.', 292530, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1968701440, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Until recently, the bronze dragonflight would have done everything in their power to prevent divergences such as these.', 292433, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958215680, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'With this waygate we\'ve established a direct way in. Good work. But we\'re not done yet.\n\nThe ethereals have deployed Field Dampeners inside this chamber. Before we can reestablish the network, they must be destroyed.\n\nAnd if you find yourself in trouble, look around. You can build more waygates from those materials you\'ve already collected.', 292292, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Styles change all the time, but nothing stays out of style forever.', '', 292179, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Why choose between substance and style when you can have both? \n\nJust not from me, not anymore. Pythagorus has what you\'re looking for now.', 292178, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You poor soul, you have met with a terrible fate.\n\nThis realm has been tampered with. I can only return you to a safer time.', 292161, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Hey there, kitty-cat, you look like you could use some threads.', '', 292135, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will create a portal for you now.', 291955, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1970995200, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You there! You look like you know your way around a vault.\n\nThe ethereals have the place on lockdown. They\'ve put up barriers and dismantled the waygates inside. There\'s evidence they\'re reconfiguring them to portal elsewhere and likely with the vault\'s contents in tow. \n\nI\'ve managed to construct this one from parts they\'ve left lying around. It will take you right inside the lion\'s den, but I must remain behind to ensure the portal back remains open.\n\nGet in there and rebuild the waygate network!', 291938, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Fearsome foes awaits you in Tazavesh. Are you prepared?\n\n|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Bone_Skull_02.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000 This dungeon is significantly more challenging than other Mythic dungeons.|r\n\nEnemies have 120% more health and inflict 120% more damage.\n\nRecommended item level: 707', '', 291802, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Greetings, mortal. Will you help your allies fight the Shadowguard?', 291731, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'And you have already met Momentus, our circumspect blacksmith.', 291705, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If your artifact was affected by temporal energy, the same could be true for the other artifacts too. I\'ll have to study them all!', '', 291704, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1958674432, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'This is Nostwin--our resident expert on being a teenager. Nostwin, are you awake?', 291703, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Well, then we\'ll simply have to make the most of the time we have, won\'t we?', 291695, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958477824, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'That being said, I promised Nozdormu that this experiment will eventually come to an end and that we will all depart from this timeline.', 291694, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958412288, 4, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Indeed. These anomalies provide us with a unique opportunity to study the flow of time and the role of the individual in shaping history.', 291692, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958346752, 4, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'But not anymore, right? After all, that is what we came here to do. Introduce changes to the past and observe the results as they occur.', 291691, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958281216, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Our presence has already created anomalies in this timeline. The Legion\'s attack, our friend\'s intervention, and the artifact they wield.', 291690, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958150144, 4, 603, 1, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Eternus, we put an end to the Legion attack on Dalaran. However, I\'m still not certain how they managed to breach its defenses.', 291688, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958084608, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We battled back the darkness, but at what cost?', 291598, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Yes, what is it?', 291575, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Stop them!', 'Stop them!', 291505, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I think we can gloss over this one.', 291498, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968177152, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It is said that knowledge is power.\n\nSurely, then, power must also be knowledge.\n\nTell me, $n. With all the knowledge you have gained, what do you now know to be true?', 291408, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1048, 6, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You have accomplished all that I have asked for and more.\n\nWhat wisdom would you share after your time with us?', 291404, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Your effort in our experiments have been most helpful, $n.\n\nBut tell me. What have you learned?', 291400, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You have learned much and taught us more.\n\nThe sands are slipping away quickly now and this timeline will soon be closed to us.\n\nLearn what else you can in the time we have left to us, then we must go and seek a safer timeline.', 291386, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 603, 1, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Legion\'s forces nearly wiped out Azeroth\'s greatest champions. In how many timelines would we have succeeded?\n\nWas it the artifacts that saved Azeroth, or perhaps something else entirely?\n\nI have my theories, but I will withhold them until we have more evidence.', 291378, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 1, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Even small changes can cause great divergences. But what changes are possible without divergence?\n\nI will subtly manipulate the Legion\'s forces to simulate what perils we may face in the not-to-distant future. Do not worry about how, you will have enough worries with your own survival.', 291377, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 603, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Perhaps you will understand in time.\n\nXal\'atath, Sargeras, the Titans--I see them all like puzzle pieces in the aether. But how they all fit together, that I do not yet know.', 291376, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Time is as varied as it is infinite.', 291375, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'No offense, but this isn\'t really what we\'re here to study.', 291349, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1968635904, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Job\'s done.', 291337, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968504832, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Jumping ahead.', 291329, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968439296, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Moving on.', 291327, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968373760, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Nothing to see here.', 291326, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968308224, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Skip.', 291324, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968242688, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'See? Everything is the same, except now we are in control of our own time. We\'re ready to proceed.', 291323, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968111616, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Like Eternus mentioned before, this experiment will eventually end. So, we have to be wise about how we spend our time.', 291322, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1968046080, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Sorry for the interruption, but we\'re going to jump you forward in time, past this moment.', 291321, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 524288, 0, 1967980544, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Let us observe what happens when we add in a dash of chaos.', 291265, 0, 0, 485, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966014464, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'When opportunity knocks, it is best to answer.', 291264, 0, 0, 485, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1965948928, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Boons and setbacks can come when one least expects them.', 291263, 0, 0, 485, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1965883392, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Every variable must be considered.', 291262, 0, 0, 485, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1965817856, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The question was not whether you would be successful--it was whether you would be successful again.', 291257, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967587328, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Time is a fantastic motivator.', 291256, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967521792, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Now these are the results I have been waiting for.', 291255, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967456256, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Your timing is impeccable.', 291254, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967390720, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'A simple turn of the hourglass and this failing shall be undone.', 291253, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967325184, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Time is a constant, and yet there never seems to be enough of it.', 291252, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967259648, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The hourglass has run empty, and with it, the prospect of greater reward.', 291251, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967194112, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'On occasion, time is simply not on your side.', 291250, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967128576, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I had hoped that this time you would have succeeded.', 291249, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966800896, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It is possible to do everything correctly and still fail. Though... perhaps not everything you did was correct.', 291248, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966735360, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Worry not. Somewhere out there is a you that exceeded expectations.', 291247, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966669824, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Not every thread is a viable candidate. I am afraid you did not make the cut.', 291246, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966604288, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We will do this as many times as necessary to get the results that we need--as we have been.', 291245, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1967063040, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Do not attempt anything out of the ordinary--it is my job to introduce the variables.', 291244, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966997504, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Try not to expect the unexpected--that is impossible.', 291243, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966931968, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We are ready to begin. Remember--we are watching.', 291242, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 851968, 0, 1966866432, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Tales of adventure are the best! Dark dungeons, terrifying monsters, shiny treasures... I want to hear all about them!\n\nIf you promise to bring back a good story, I might even let you borrow a keystone.', 290372, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 603, 6, 0, 0, 63796),
('Remember when I took your artifact from its proper time and place? I used the infinite bronze to craft a simulacrum to replace it.', '', 290284, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1971388416, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Fulfill your oath!', 290210, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1724579840, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Kill the Ravel and their followers!', 290209, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1724514304, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We... have no choice.', 290208, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1724448768, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Oracles... Wastelanders...', 290207, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1724383232, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', '<sighs>', 290206, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1724317696, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Obey. Or die as oath-breakers.', '', 290205, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1724252160, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('And by sacred oath, so do all of you.', '', 290204, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1724186624, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'How could we fight for you? You serve the All-Devouring!', 290203, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1724121088, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Honor it now, and slay the Ravel as you swore to do!', '', 290202, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1724055552, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Your oath to me still stands!', '', 290201, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1723990016, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('No. With Dimensius as my master, I have been remade in the Void.', '', 290200, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1723924480, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You died! And our oath died with you!', 290199, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1723858944, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'King Salhadaar...', 290197, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1723793408, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You dare break your oath?!', '', 290196, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1723727872, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You dare defy your king?', '', 290195, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1723662336, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oracles of K\'aresh!', '', 290194, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1723596800, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Salhadaar survived?', 290193, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1723531264, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<groans painfully>', '', 290190, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 1723203584, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', '<groans painfully>', 290189, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1723138048, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Petals and pollen, K\'aresh is reborn anew.', 290135, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1719926784, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'My life for K\'aresh.', 290134, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1719861248, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'And K\'aresh will be strengthened.', 290133, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719795712, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'unburdened...', 290132, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719730176, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'A soul will pass through K\'aresh and emerge reborn,', 290131, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719664640, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Exchange!', 290130, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719599104, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'But he can still be saved...', 290129, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719533568, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'fading and near extinction.', 290128, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719468032, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Here he is,', 290127, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719402496, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'K\'aresh.', 290126, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719336960, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Which oath takes precedence?', 290125, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1719271424, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'you were an oracle of K\'aresh.', 290124, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719205888, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Before you fought for the Nexus-King,', 290123, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719140352, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'No more posturing.', 290122, 0, 0, 0, 358, 0, 262144, 0, 1719074816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Be quiet.', 290121, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1719009280, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will die oath-bound!', 290120, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1718943744, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will die with honor!', 290119, 0, 0, 0, 326, 0, 262144, 0, 1718878208, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('A fleshling? In Untethered Space? Interesting.\n\nWhy am I not killing you on sight? Because I might need your help.\n\nYou see? You and the Trust think that the Shadowguard are all puppets. Not me, oh no. I deserve more than this--more than being a grunt.\n\nThere are two sentinels in the area named Duwal and Za\'drin. They die, and I become a sentinel. I could climb the ranks from there. What\'s in it for you or the Trust? Nothing right now, but in the long run, I\'d owe you one.\n\nWhat do you say? Get rid of them for me? The sentinels are not easy prey.', 'A fleshling? In Untethered Space? Interesting.\n\nWhy am I not killing you on sight? Because I might need your help.\n\nYou see? You and the Trust think that the Shadowguard are all puppets. Not me, oh no. I deserve more than this--more than being a grunt.\n\nThere are two sentinels in the area named Duwal and Za\'drin. They die, and I become a sentinel. I could climb the ranks from there. What\'s in it for you or the Trust? Nothing right now, but in the long run, I\'d owe you one.\n\nWhat do you say? Get rid of them for me? The sentinels are not easy prey.', 289877, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'ll be watching from a distance. Good luck, $p.', 289830, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'If I remember this part of the timeline correctly, your $c allies will soon be requiring your help.', 289740, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Watch your step.', 289728, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1959329792, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'And I don\'t want to fly you all around the Broken Isles myself.', 289727, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1959264256, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'After all, we\'re supposed to be keeping a low profile here.', 289726, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1959198720, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'When we get back to Krasus\' Landing we\'re going to get you a flying mount all your own.', 289724, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1959133184, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So take heart in knowing that what you are doing here is important.', 289723, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1959067648, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I should know. After all, I\'ve known her for... well, forever.', 289722, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1959002112, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Don\'t let this get to your head, but Eternus almost never gives anyone that much praise.', 289721, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958936576, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'There we go. It feels good to stretch my wings. Hang on.', 289720, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958871040, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'One moment, please.', 289719, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1958805504, 4, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Squick hear bad goblins leave Funny Candles in Kriegval\'s Rest!\n\nSo Squick come, but instead find darkness!\n\nSquick fearful of dark. No like dark. But you here now. You help Squick! \n\nFind Funny Candles for Squick and make darkness go away.', '', 289671, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 20, 412, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Are they gone?', 289667, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1957888000, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We\'ll speak again soon, and hopefully under better circumstances.', '', 289660, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957822464, 4, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Daughter? I have no children!\n\nLook, I never turn down fresh meat. I thought I could use the nag, but the blue color worried me--could have been void contamination. That taints the aroma!\n\nI got rid of it, quickly!\n\nNow, you do me a favor, and I\'ll tell you exactly where it went.', '', 289370, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('What? Slateback? \n\nNo, no. Absolutely not. Nothing of the sort here. We use only the finest quality meat. Every dish is prepared with the utmost care and the highest standards.\n\nYou have my word!', '', 289360, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('That Blue Slateback? \n\nOnce it was released from it\'s crate, it was no longer suitable for the Oasis reclamation. Contaminants could have compromised it\'s purity.\n\nI gave it to Xy\'Zin, he said it would make a wonderful gift for his daughter\'s birthday.', '', 289355, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Fate toys with my heart, it seems.', 289276, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Well done, $p! Once again, Dalaran is in your debt.', '', 289161, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1957756928, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Fel Lord Nezmet is in command of the invasion portals. Dispatching him will break the siege.', '', 289156, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1957691392, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('$p! I\'ve discovered how we can expel the Legion from Dalaran!', '', 289155, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1957625856, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Brilliant! You\'ve done it. You\'ve forged the infinite bronze.', '', 289143, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957298176, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Perfect. Now we just forge the infused anchoring materials into infinite bronze.', '', 289141, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957232640, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Excellent. Now infuse the fibers into the anchoring materials.', '', 289140, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957167104, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Good job. Now we need to separate the temporal fibers from the frayed threads.', '', 289138, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957101568, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('First we\'ll need to use the forge to prepare the anchoring materials and separate the infusing power from them.', '', 289137, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957036032, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Well, it\'s served its purpose and none are the wiser. Erus would be quite happy if you scrapped it to reclaim our materials.', '', 289084, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1971322880, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ah! The simulacrum I left in place of the artifact that I retrieved from the timeline.', '', 289083, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1971257344, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This artifact has been altered--and enhanced--by this timeline\'s temporal energy... Its powers are different from before!', '', 288990, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957429248, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Have you decided on your specialization?\n\n|cnRED_FONT_COLOR:<To change your class specialization, navigate to your Talents (default hotkey: N).>|r', '', 288942, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Excellent choice! Now I\'ll reach through time and space to secure your artifact.', '', 288940, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1957363712, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oddities like that one tend to be great sources of temporal energy, thanks to the actions of their owners.', '', 288907, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1956904960, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('That bent and battered blade has seen exactly as many battles as you think it has.', '', 288906, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1956839424, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('An ancient tablet locked away in a dusty chest? What a waste of valuable knowledge!', '', 288891, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1956773888, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('$p! Moratari let me know what\'s going on. Let\'s get to work!', '', 288766, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956577280, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So, you have some big shoes to fill. But Momentus can help you live up to your own legend! Find him at the Obliterum Forge.', 288761, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1956511744, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'ve discovered why you have amnesia! When you entered this timeline, you took the place of \"another you,\" a hero of vast renown.', 288759, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1956446208, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I still do not know.\n\nSomething went wrong with our spell.\n\nInstead of banishing the Legion forces across Azeroth and abjuring them from Dalaran upon our arrival, somehow they slipped inside.\n\nI aim to discover how that came to pass, and whatever, or whoever, is responsible.', '', 288751, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 1, 1005, 0, 0, 63796),
('It always seems darkest before the dawn, doesn\'t it, $n?', '', 288747, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('These demons will not take Dalaran! Meet me in the Chamber of the Guardian!', '', 288743, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956184064, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Your memory loss is certainly unexpected. Help Khadgar while I try to figure out what happened.', 288742, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1955987456, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', '$p! There you are. I thought we\'d lost you.', 288739, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 0, 1955921920, 4, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Kirin Tor, stand firm! We must hold the line against the Legion!', '', 288687, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 65536, 1956052992, 4, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We just had a position open up and the schedule\'s tight, so I\'m authorizing an emergency offer as a temp. Get in there, probie!', '', 288652, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Hey, $c, you ever thought of an exciting career in unstable ordinance disposal?', '', 288651, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', '<Agos gives you a knowing nod.>', 288388, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Don\'t forget to record your data points.', 288313, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'When you\'re ready to depart I\'ll take you back to Krasus\' Landing.', 288310, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The Temporal Attendant has come to your aid many times recently. You can\'t quite place it, but something about its gaze feels... condescending.>', '<The Temporal Attendant has come to your aid many times. You can\'t quite place it, but something about its gaze feels... condescending.>', 288301, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Good to see you again, $p.\n\nIf on your journeys you have need of another weapon, you can always find me here at the Infinite Bazaar.', '', 288266, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'A pleasure, $n.\n\nOh!\n\n<Lidamorrutu motions toward your artifact.>\n\nSuch a wealth of potential power should not remain untapped.', 288260, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oh, ok. More snacks for me then.\n\n<Nostwin pops something delicious into his tiny maw and munches on it.>\n\nSpeaking of snacks. If you ever need snacks or naps come see me. I have been studying inn keeping and have perfected pre-warming beds for guests.\n\nAlso, I solved the issue of crumbs in bed, so now you can snack and nap without worry.', '', 288247, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 1, 0, 0, 63796),
('<Nostwin hands you something delicious to snack on, and then munches on some himself.>\n\nI love snacks. Oh, and naps.\n\nSo, if you ever need snacks or naps come see me. I\'ve been studying inn keeping and have perfected the art of pre-warming beds for guests.\n\nAlso, I solved the issue of crumbs in bed, so now you can snack and nap without worry.', '', 288246, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oh, hi!\n\nI\'m Nostwin.\n\nAre you hungry?\n\nI have snacks!', '', 288242, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 63796);

INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `VoiceOverPriorityID`, `SoundKitID1`, `SoundKitID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('<Nostwin munches on something delicious.>', '', 288241, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You have been MOST efficacious in your endeavors!\n\nWe approach my clandestine subterranean operation: a sequestered storehouse of my MOST temerarious yet ingenious apparatuses!\n\nI\'ve got JUST the idea to rid ourselves of this mucilaginous menace.\n\nFIRST! Excise these anomalous ectozoa impeding entry! Then, once inside, you\'ll collect what we need to construct a contraption that will buffet this Black Blood into oblivion!!', '', 288228, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Dalaran will not fall. Not while I still draw breath.', '', 288205, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The journey here from Telogrus was not without risk or complication. Some of our riftwalkers were severely injured as they traversed the space between worlds. But they were able to bring with them enough of a force to defeat the Shadowguard. \n \nHelp Riftblade Maella with the wounded. I need to take the measure of our new allies.', 287978, 0, 0, 669, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<This device appears to function as a teleporter to additional nodes once they are found and activated.>', '<This device appears to function as a teleporter to additional nodes once they are found and activated.>', 287742, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The you-of-this-timeline has accomplished deeds beyond your imagination and the people of this timeline owe much to them.\n\nThey are a mighty hero.\n\nYou have quite the legend to live up to, $n.', '', 287725, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 603, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<Momentus leans back, satisfied with his inspection.>\n\nAs Moratari has told you, this timeline has quite a few holes in it. The you-of-this-timeline stepped through one of them and swapped places with you.\n\nIn short, you are you, but... different.', '', 287722, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Reinforcing the magical barriers has bought us plenty of time against the Legion to figure out exactly what\'s going on with you.\n\n<Momentus scrutinizes you from toes to nose.>\n\nHmmm.\n\nAs I suspected.', '', 287718, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('There are few problems that a little heat and a hammer cannot solve.', '', 287713, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Ironically, we don\'t have a lot of time at this particular juncture to sort out what happened to you.\n\nThe short version is that the time travel and Dalaran\'s teleportation spell in this timeline have gone awry. I\'m not sure exactly how, just yet, but I\'m sure your gaps in memory were caused by that.\n\nRight now, though, we need you to focus on defending Dalaran. I can promise you answers as soon as I get them myself.', 287552, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'These are exciting times, $n.', 287549, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'m Moratari.\n\nYou and I are studying this timeline together, along with a few others.\n\nHowever, the teleportation of Dalaran has had a mishap, which seems to have affected you and the city in unforeseen ways. Dalaran is being overrun by the Legion and Archmage Khadgar needs your help.\n\nHe should be projecting an image around here somewhere to help direct the city\'s defenses and organize the safety of Dalaran\'s citizens.\n\nFind Khadgar and offer him your assistance.', 287497, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1005, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Can it truly be? At long last, the All-Devouring is vanquished... my world, my people... we are finally avenged.', '', 287433, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 1535705088, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Some sacrifices are inevitable, I suppose. But fear not, Alleria. I always find a way to survive.', 287431, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1535967232, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Which would leave you trapped in here. How selfless of you.', 287430, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1535901696, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'ll hold open the way so you can make your escape... but to do so, I must remain on this side of the portal.', 287428, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1535836160, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Do not savor this victory for too long. With Dimensius\'s defeat, the Dark Heart is on the verge of collapse.', 287426, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 458752, 0, 1535770624, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You arrive just in time, $n. Hunt is afoot.\n\nKnights of Brown Table drive Beste Glatisant to here. Terrible beast, very dangerous. Ate many squirelings.\n\nGreat glory to valiant knight who track it to lair and slay it.\n\nLostalot already very glorious, as can see, so will give you first try, if want.\n\nJust follow Snufflehounds, they lead you right to it.', '', 287423, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Embrace my rule. Swear your fealty to me.', '', 287404, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1669726208, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Run! Ha ha ha! Run for your lives!', 287315, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670643712, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('To the slaughter.', '', 287310, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1519190016, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The power. The vitality. The Void flows through me!', '', 287301, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1519124480, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('How will we stop him?', '', 287254, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1523515392, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The All-Devouring is nearly reborn. Go to the core of the Manaforge. Prove your worth to me.', 287251, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523318784, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Hold the line! We cannot let them through!', '', 287249, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1523056640, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Do not let them get a foothold! Attack!', '', 287248, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522991104, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Shadowguard, to me! Do not let them pass!', '', 287247, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522925568, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Do not fight! Embrace my rule. Embrace the All-Devouring.', '', 287246, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522860032, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Pitiful corporeals! You are no match for my might!', '', 287243, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522794496, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('When Dimensius arrives, you will all pay for your insolence!', '', 287240, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522728960, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'If only the rest of you had that kind of commitment! You will need it now... Dimensius\'s reformation is inevitable!', 287236, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1522139136, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'In the next chamber, Araz uses his machines to feed arcane energy into the Dark Heart.', 287225, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521811456, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Return to the center of the Manaforge. We need to determine our next course of action.', 287223, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521745920, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It must be slain. I will stay here and make sure no one comes to its defense.', 287222, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521614848, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Destroying this construct should lower the Manaforge\'s defenses.', '', 287221, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1519648768, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We have tripped the Manaforge\'s security measures and cannot materialize.', '', 287220, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1519583232, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Or my children will take it from you! To me, my Shadowguard!', 287218, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1519845376, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'In hand, but not for long. We must keep him from regaining power.', 287209, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534722048, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The Manaforge is stable. What of Dimensius?', '', 287208, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1535115264, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Thank the Light you\'re alive!', 287207, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1535049728, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We\'re in Dimensius\'s domain now.', 287206, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534656512, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So stay close. And listen to me.', 287205, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1537605632, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'ve got you!', 287204, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534525440, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Kill his minions. Keep pressing him!', 287203, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534459904, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Follow me. And try to stay alive, hm?', 287201, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534328832, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You\'ve done well so far. Surprising. But we\'re not done yet.', 287200, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534263296, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We\'re not mere mortals. Show him our strength!', 287199, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534197760, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We must strike--now!', 287123, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1534132224, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Peasants! Bow before my power!', '', 286992, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518862336, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My reign... ends...', '', 286988, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518600192, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I will not be usurped!', '', 286987, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518534656, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Audience denied.', '', 286986, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518469120, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Long live the Nexus-King!', '', 286985, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518403584, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Peasant.', '', 286984, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518338048, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Take your leave.', '', 286983, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518272512, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Plunge into eternal night!', '', 286982, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518206976, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Deepest darkness envelop you.', '', 286981, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518141440, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I will shatter the sky!', '', 286979, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1518010368, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If I must rip the Nether asunder, you will die!', '', 286978, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517944832, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Stars are birthed on my command.', '', 286977, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517879296, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My rule will be infinite! Look upon me and despair!', '', 286975, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517748224, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Forgive me, loyal steed. Your final command is to give me your strength.', '', 286974, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517682688, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('By my will be broken.', '', 286972, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517551616, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Shadowguard! To me!', '', 286967, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517355008, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Shadowguard! Destroy the heretics.', '', 286966, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517289472, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We will be oracles again!', 286818, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1489764352, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The enemies of K\'aresh will pay!', 286814, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1489698816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This place looks wonderful.\n\nWhat an accomplishment. It\'s like I have been transported back in time. \n\nHow are the animals doing?', 'This place looks wonderful.\n\nWhat an accomplishment. It\'s like I have been transported back in time. \n\nHow are the animals doing?', 286803, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My valiant steed, return to your master!', '', 286801, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517158400, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I suppose it could be said that this eco-dome is coming along well. After all, I do not wish to appear uncharitable.\n\nWhat is your job here, fleshing?', 'I suppose it could be said that this eco-dome is coming along well. After all, I do not wish to appear uncharitable.\n\nWhat is your job here, fleshing?', 286800, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Follow me into the Void.', '', 286799, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517092864, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You will serve me.', '', 286798, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1517027328, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Burn them down!', '', 286797, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516961792, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Loyal beast, lay them to waste.', '', 286796, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516896256, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Kill them, my winged beauty.', '', 286795, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516830720, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Execute them, my drake.', '', 286794, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516765184, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Strike you in twain!', '', 286789, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516437504, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('By my hand be cleaved.', '', 286788, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516371968, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I will break you!', '', 286787, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516306432, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Submit to my rule.', '', 286786, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1516240896, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You won\'t escape. Ha ha ha...', 286781, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670774784, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('To ground. Like a beast.', '', 286778, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528037376, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I have you now.', '', 286777, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1527971840, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It\'s only a little pain and misery.', 286772, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1526857728, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Fear and despair for all.', 286771, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1526792192, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Delicious. Mm.', 286769, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1526661120, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Fracture your soul. And your mind.', 286768, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1526595584, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'My glaive thirsts.', 286764, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670840320, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Feel my wrath.', 286763, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1669922816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Face me. Or face the flames!', 286761, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670578176, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Submit to the Void!', '', 286759, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1527775232, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'My rage... fades...', 286756, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670119424, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'They... got me?', 286755, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1526464512, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I see... nothing.', '', 286754, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1527578624, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'That was way too easy.', 286729, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1526398976, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Hardly a challenge.', 286726, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670053888, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Now your power is mine!', '', 286719, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1527513088, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Now you know true power!', '', 286718, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1527447552, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Is that all you\'ve got?', '', 286715, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1527316480, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I will prevail. The ritual will continue!', '', 286676, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530658816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Meddlers! You cannot stop the ritual.', '', 286675, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530593280, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Dimensius will feed on your energies!', '', 286671, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530396672, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I will allow no interference!', '', 286669, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530265600, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Unaccounted-for variables must be removed.', '', 286668, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530200064, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Heretics! You may have disrupted my ritual, but my faith will fuel the machine!', '', 286659, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530068992, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The ritual! No matter. What is fealty without sacrifice?', '', 286658, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1530003456, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Success! Dimensius will reign again!', '', 286655, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529937920, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The pylons are at full power. Your part in this ritual is to die!', '', 286654, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529872384, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Energies of Order, gather, transmute.', '', 286651, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529675776, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The pylons\' energies are at their zenith. Dimensius will receive their power!', '', 286648, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529479168, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Yes, the pylons\' energy grows. The ritual is almost complete!', '', 286647, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529413632, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Safeguard the machine!', '', 286635, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529151488, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('To me, guardians of the machine.', '', 286634, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529085952, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Circuit complete. Wither and die!', '', 286631, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1529020416, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Your energy fuels my machine.', '', 286629, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528954880, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('More power! The ritual must continue.', '', 286581, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528823808, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('A minor setback!', '', 286559, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528758272, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Foolish corporeals! My sacrifice completes the ritual and hastens our Lord\'s return.', '', 286555, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528561664, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Dimensius thanks you for your energy contribution.', '', 286553, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528496128, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My machine will fulfill the prophecy!', '', 286552, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528430592, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Now, I can complete the ritual in peace.', '', 286551, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528365056, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('No energy wasted. You will fuel my machine!', '', 286549, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528233984, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The machine must not be stopped.', '', 286548, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528168448, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My important work cannot be interrupted!', '', 286547, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1528102912, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Shadowguard will be your end!', 286546, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1516109824, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will not let you interrupt my rituals!', 286543, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1515913216, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'No! The Shadowguard must rise... I cannot return... to the Void!', 286541, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1515782144, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You trifled with the matron of the Shadowguard. What outcome did you expect?', 286536, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1515651072, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Pathetic. I have more important tasks to attend to.', 286535, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1515585536, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Get back! You will not harm my children!', 286521, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1515126784, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You will die by my hand, interloper!', 286519, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514995712, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Pray that I don\'t get bit, $p.', '', 286507, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I command you. Rip away their offending flesh!', 286505, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514799104, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Obey me! Kill the interlopers!', 286504, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514733568, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Rise! Fight for the Shadowguard!', 286503, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514668032, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Children! Honor is within your grasp! Take their lives!', 286493, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514602496, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Prove your worth, young ones.', 286492, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514536960, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Rise and claim your first victory!', 286491, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514471424, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'They are your playthings, my children.', 286489, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514405888, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You will not forestall my children\'s return to life!', 286476, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514143744, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Fleshbound, how dare you interrupt my sacred binding?', 286475, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1514078208, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I... need time. We will discuss this outcome later.', 286383, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523908608, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'And now we must stop her--more powerful, and without my mentor, our ally who understood her best.', 286382, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523843072, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Dimensius had to be stopped. But in the end, the one who profited most was Xal\'atath.', 286381, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523777536, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Locus-Walker should have listened to me. But what would it have mattered?', 286380, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523712000, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We stopped Dimensius... but now his power is Xal\'atath\'s.', 286379, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523646464, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We won\'t. Not alone. Your \"champions\" will hold off Dimensius until we can join the battle.', 286378, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523580928, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Alleria is fighting back the Shadowguard. We\'re barely holding the Manaforge together.', '', 286376, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1523384320, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'And now, the final reckoning is at hand.', 286373, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523253248, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Another king falls. You should be glad I know a loyal, tractable servant when I see one.', 286370, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1523974144, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Xal... \'atath? No!', '', 286369, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1523187712, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Deal with Salhadaar. My forces will hold his Shadowguard!', 286364, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1522663424, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'My Riftwalkers are decreasing their numbers. This is taking far too long!', 286363, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1522597888, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Flesh-bound wretches! Shadowguard, stop their advance!', '', 286362, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522532352, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Oh, I hope they try to run away! It\'s more fun when they do...', 286291, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1522466816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Look, some poor souls lost in the wastes...', '', 286290, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522335744, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Ah, that\'s the thrill I need... I need bigger prey.', 286289, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1670184960, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'What zealotry. What loyalty. Sacrificing himself to power the machine.', 286285, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1522073600, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The rest of you--evacuate to the wastes and find a way back in. I will gather my forces and meet you once I\'ve done so.', 286282, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1522270208, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The surge of energy will tear reality apart--and will quickly wake Dimensius. Xal\'atath and I will try to stabilize the Manaforge.', '', 286273, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522204672, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I will not allow the disruption of Lord Dimensius\'s resurrection!', '', 286241, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1522008064, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('If one embraces the Void, it often embraces you back.', '', 286194, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1501167616, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('A soul untethered into Void is a tragedy. One who willingly gives themself to it, a criminal.', '', 286192, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1501233152, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Kill the Manaforger before he wakes Dimensius. I\'ve brought down the security system blocking the way.', 286184, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521876992, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Without that beast, the Shadowguard\'s numbers will dwindle.', 286138, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521680384, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The beast the Manaforge uses to create the Shadowguard\'s bindings is up ahead.', 286121, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521549312, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Go. Return to the center of the Manaforge. We must stop Dimensius before he can reform.', '', 286093, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1519976448, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Now, no more Shadowguard will be bound. I will stay here to see if any Unbound can be saved.', '', 286083, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1519910912, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Come. Give me your soul.', 286047, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1519779840, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You are not bound.', 286046, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1519714304, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Kill the Soulbinder to cripple their reinforcements. I will keep any security measures from impeding you.', '', 286045, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1521483776, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Here, souls are plucked from the Void and bound with special silk made in the Manaforge.', '', 286027, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1521418240, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'One path leads towards where the Shadowguard produce arcane wrappings. The other, to the mage who binds them.', 286025, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521352704, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Shadowguard? Do what you will. I have my own plans for the Manaforge.', 286023, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 0, 1521287168, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Now that we\'re inside, we should deal with the Shadowguard before pushing onward to the control chamber.', '', 286022, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 196608, 1521156096, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('How may I help you?', '', 285655, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Well done, traveler. Their agents and their equipment are ours for the taking.', 285608, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1501954048, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Shadowguard think their untethered agents are beyond the Trust\'s reach. They aren\'t.', 285605, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1502019584, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I shoulda brought more gear!', '', 285537, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1437859840, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('So I have heard. \n\nVe\'nari was telling me of some of your exploits. She will never admit it, but she keeps quite the eye on you.\n\nPerhaps I should as well. You certainly lead an exciting life. A bit too adventurous for my liking, but I can always live vicariously through you.', '', 285495, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<Om\'talad looks at the bees buzzing around the flowers nearby.>\n\nI was worried when we first started. You cannot simply replace a creature from one eco-system with another. It will never be exactly as it was. \n\nBut it is close enough. It is functioning, and we shall claw back K\'aresh one area at a time until we restore our home.', '', 285494, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I have been doing project management for a long time. I have retrofitted cities and managed trade routes across different planes of existence. \n\nThis has been an easy project in comparison. Now, if I had you on every project, I am certain any and all problems would be solved with relative ease--but in terms of size, complexity, and everything else, it was still a fairly easy project. \n\nDespite this, it has been the most fulfilling. Nothing else even comes close. To be a part of rebuilding K\'aresh\'s ecosystem is... well... to be part of the future of my world. And for that, I am eternally grateful to you.\n\nHow are you feeling about it?', '', 285473, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'m so sorry!\n\nI promise to bee more thoughtful in the future. Oh, this is such a bee-lated apology. I should probably leaf it at that bee-fore your brain has a bloom-ing explosion!', 285451, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It\'s good to have a captive audience for my marvelous wit. Would you believe that the botanists in Silvermoon asked me to stop?\n\nI told them I couldn\'t. I was planting too many joke seeds. They stopped talking to me after that.\n\nHonestly, no taste.', 285447, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Oh it\'s been wonderful! Look at all we\'ve managed to do.\n\nWhen you brought me here, this place had only a small amount of animals in it. Now you can\'t move for all the animals! And everything is working in sync. Honestly, I\'d love to do it all again. \n\nI\'ve asked Ve\'nari to build a bigger eco-dome we can move things to and she just looked at me blankly. I mean, she always looks at you blankly what with having no movable face, but I got the impression it was even more blank than normal.\n\nI wasn\'t really expecting to become a bee expert either. I suppose you could call me a \"bee-tanist\" now.', 285444, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ah, you an\' I... We\'ve done a lot together over the years.\n\nBut I think what we\'ve accomplished on this blasted wasteland o\' a rock is the best thing I\'ve ever done--even if it\'s not the best thing you\'ve ever done, you world saver.\n\nThe circle o\' life is important, but this is really my first time being on the other side o\' the circle than killing--an\' I\'ll tell ye, it feels good. \n\nHow about you? How are ye feeling?', '', 285414, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Heh, don\'t I know it. \n\nYou know, it\'s a bit inspiring really. Don\'t know that I told you this but, well... I saw all the things you accomplished for Azeroth--you an\' others--an\' thought to myself, \"Hemet old boy, you could be doing more than just hunting.\"\n\nNot sure if the old crew is quite ready for it yet, but maybe one day we can help save a little slice o\' Azeroth too.', '', 285413, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Maybe I can gather the old crew together an\' try to do something similar for rare creatures in Azeroth? Something to think about at least. \n\nAt least once Ve\'nari is done with me, eh?', '', 285412, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ve been around the world a lot. Been around a lot o\' worlds in fact.\n\nBut I think what we\'ve accomplished on this blasted wasteland o\' a rock is the best thing I\'ve ever done. The circle o\' life is important, but this is really my first time being on the other side o\' the circle than killing--and I\'ll tell you, it feels good. \n\nHow about you? How are ye feeling?', '', 285409, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oh wow! I didn\'t know about all that--I just thought you were a regular uplander!\n\nDo all uplanders save the world regularly? How often is the world in danger? Should I be worried? Although I guess if it hasn\'t exploded yet I don\'t need to be worried.\n\nAnyhoo, thank you for everything you\'ve done above and below and everywhere else! I\'m glad the world hasn\'t ended yet. Although I guess this world has? I mean our world. Although even this world seems sort of all right for an exploded world. \n\nDo you think if our world ended we\'d get fancy bodies like the brokers? Do you think they\'d trade for one?\n\nMaybe I\'ll go ask later.', '', 285406, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('As well ya should, buddy! You\'ve been tearing around here like a bat in a cavern, helpin\' out with everything anyone put in front of ya!\n\nJust looking at ya makes me all sleepy with all the work you\'ve been doing. Phew!\n\nHmm... Maybe I should go take a nap?', '', 285405, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Who\'d a\' thought about helping an entire eco-system grow just because they weren\'t smelling right? Heck, not me! And on another... world... in the open air...\n\nYou know, maybe I just won\'t think about that part too much. \n\nBut I\'ve never been prouder, and that\'s saying something! I\'ve made some pretty great scents! Why, I\'ve won best aroma ten years in a row in Mmarl! \n\nWait, what was the question? Oh! Yeah I\'m feeling pretty great about all we accomplished. What about you?', '', 285401, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Why is everyone always leaving?', '', 284353, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You better be taking care of those snakes, Hemet!', 284352, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Fitz grunts.', '', 284351, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Time to go. I\'m sure I\'ll be back again before ye know it.', '', 284350, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We intercept these boxes all the time. They can be anything. We may need your help again.', '', 284291, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1499004928, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Our technomancers are having difficulty with cracking the security on some transdimensional shipments we\'ve intercepted. Perhaps you will have better luck opening it?', '', 284290, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1498939392, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Madame Noodles, Mister Snuggles, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284091, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Madame Noodles, Slim, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284090, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Madame Noodles, Indigo, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284089, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Scarlet, Mister Snuggles, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284088, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Scarlet, Slim, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284087, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Scarlet, Indigo, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284086, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Ember, Mister Snuggles, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284085, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Ember, Slim, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284084, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Well, this is just junk. But I\'ll see what I can do. Meet me on the plains of K\'aresh.', 284076, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I believe the saying is, \"It\'s not junk, it\'s treasure.\" Yes?', 284075, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('What\'re you gonna pick? The suspense is killin\' me!', '', 284074, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The creatures lost on K\'aresh can live again. I marvel even myself sometimes.', 284073, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Come. Let us see the fruits of my labors. And yours, of course.', 284070, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'m right behind ye, $p. I canna wait!', '', 284063, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Huzzah!', 284059, 0, 0, 4, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Huzzah!', '', 284058, 0, 0, 53, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Huzzah!', 284057, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Huzzah!', '', 284056, 0, 0, 4, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Three cheers for $p, Ember, Indigo, an\' the snakelets!', '', 284055, 0, 0, 22, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'This is an important step in the restoration of K\'aresh. Do not disappoint me.', 284052, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Bring me the essence of k\'arrocs, and with it we shall create life.', 284051, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Get yer speedy boots on--this one\'s a fast one!', '', 284050, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Use the vacuum to hoover up the ooze. Do not worry--it is going to a safe place for processing. I have made sure of it.', 284049, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Alright, I\'ll meet ye back there.', '', 284046, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Just look at \'em. So adorable.', '', 284040, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('So wonderful. The miracle o\' life!', '', 284039, 0, 0, 18, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('$n, will you do the honors and help \'em along?', '', 284036, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Look at that. Three eggs!', '', 284035, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'If the ooze from the necrorays can produce a profit, that can help offset costs of the Oasis. Bring me some.', 283965, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Just be careful not to let them birdies see you take their eggs!', '', 283957, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Let\'s get these critters over to Primus and give \'em a test with some K\'areshi animals. Meet ye in there.', '', 283933, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I might have to make a run back to grab somethin\' from Ve\'nari while you\'re busy.', '', 283930, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The next part\'s gonna be a wee bit tricky getting all o\' these snakes to the Oasis.', '', 283929, 0, 0, 273, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I imagine the snakes are gettin\' a wee peckish.', '', 283928, 0, 0, 273, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ll figure somethin\' out for food.', '', 283926, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Salutations and solicitation!\n\nYou have a spare second or three? This teleporter is one of many I\'ve installed in these depths. They\'re designed to hasten the intrepid spelunker\'s... spelunking. But just before I could flip the switch, I noticed a weird ooze seeping around. Nasty stuff. Don\'t touch it!\n\nThe ooze has EMBIGGENED and EMBOLDENED the local larva! Those flagitious fiends are now chomping on my precious energy pylons. They\'re rendering my efforts of alacritous conveyance moot. MOOT!\n\nI beseech you! Slay those worms and take back any detritus they\'ve devoured. Only then can you repair the pylons and get my network back online!', '', 283917, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 20, 412, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'When you see Hemet tell him... No, nevermind. Return once the rays are safe.', 283859, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You deal with that copycat hack. I\'ll round up some necrorays for you.', '', 283856, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('It is nice to have an apprentice again. There is much work to do!', '', 283848, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('It is so nice to have you back, apprentice. There is much work to do!', '', 283846, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Perhaps if you are very good, you will get a lapbug of your very own, $n. One day.', 283842, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I didn\'t think so. \n\nNow go--play to your skills. Bring me hat pictures.', 283831, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Well, I do not. \n\nJust accept that you will not know everything. The universe will always present its mysteries, much like myself.', 283830, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Do you have the time for me to explain complex matter distortion mechanics?\n\nWhat about the five thermonucleus tenants?\n\nThe Holdian principles?', 283827, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'With science, $n. \n\nThe answer is always with science.\n\nIt is neither painful nor permanent.', 283825, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You\'re right. I have no trust for any of you.', 283792, 0, 0, 396, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488846848, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'But for Azeroth to survive, you can trust the ren\'dorei will defeat the All-Devouring.', 283791, 0, 0, 396, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488912384, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Trust? Trust is overrated. But we all want to survive, and isn\'t that enough?', 283786, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488781312, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Together we will destroy the All-Devouring. The only other choice is our own destruction.', 283785, 0, 0, 1005, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488715776, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Such pessimism. Do you really think I would have thrown in my lot for a hopeless cause?', 283783, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488650240, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Not an ounce of trust between us. What hope do we have of victory?', 283782, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488584704, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Ravel will pay for their crimes in time.', 283781, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488519168, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796);

INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `VoiceOverPriorityID`, `SoundKitID1`, `SoundKitID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What of your vendetta, Soul-Scribe? Should I prepare for your blade in my back?', '', 283780, 0, 0, 396, 256, 0, 262144, 1488453632, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Perhaps your band of outcasts will finish the job this time?', 283778, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488388096, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The ren\'dorei are gathered. They have fought the Shadowguard before.', 283777, 0, 0, 396, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488322560, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The portation tag will teleport \'em directly to the Oasis. See ye there.', '', 283763, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Be careful not to catch yourself with the spray. You\'ll be fighting off thorntails for days!', '', 283737, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'ve been freeing lapbugs for hours. I just need a bit of a rest before I can go again.', 283734, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Now that you have completed your work for me, Rhubarn was looking for you.', 283733, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ll carefully gather up these two an\' meet ye inside the dome to the north.', '', 283694, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Pilot Marsha cackles.', 283669, 0, 0, 153, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('What? Where\'s everyone going?', '', 283668, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Fitz grunts.', '', 283667, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Bye, everyone. I\'m hopin\' to see ye again real soon!', '', 283666, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Och! Did these plants get stinkier since we\'ve been here?', '', 283665, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I... have done it.', 283661, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Use the console, $n. Create new life.', 283660, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('WHAT?!', '', 283657, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Specimens: optimal. Female: gravid.', '', 283655, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Data collection complete.', '', 283654, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Analysis complete.', '', 283652, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Greetings <insert user name here.> I have been procured to assist with the data analysis of <species unknown.> It is our hope that <process 06> will prove essential to success.\n\nInitiate to proceed.', '', 283634, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Thanks, Mister Hemet! Thanks, $p!', 'Thanks, Mister Hemet! Thanks, $p!', 283626, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Nay, young one. You should all head back to your parents now. They\'ll be worried about ye.', '', 283625, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We\'ll help you, Mister Hemet!', 'We\'ll help you, Mister Hemet!', 283624, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The male snake flicks his tongue out at you warily.\n\nWhat will you name him?>', '<The male snake flicks his tongue out at you warily.\n\nWhat will you name him?>', 283612, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The male snake flicks his tongue out at you warily.>', '<The male snake flicks his tongue out at you warily.>', 283610, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('$n? What--nevermind. Can ye help an old dwarf out?', '', 283608, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The female snake looks up with intelligent eyes as if she is judging you.>', '<The female snake looks up with intelligent eyes as if she is judging you.>', 283599, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The female snake looks up with intelligent eyes as if she is judging you.\n\nWhat will you name her?>', '<The female snake looks up with intelligent eyes as if she is judging you.\n\nWhat will you name her?>', 283587, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Great! You\'re here, $p. Time to make certain the snakes are a good fit for K\'aresh.', '', 283570, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('So soon? Okay! Just use the portal and I\'ll meet ye back at the Oasis.', '', 283501, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Be careful if you\'re after these two. They\'ve been feistier than usual lately for some reason.', 283483, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I really appreciate ye doing this, $p. I don\'t think those two snakes like me one bit!', '', 283482, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('While you\'re out gatherin\' the moss, we\'ll keep the talbuk from destroyin\' the camp.', '', 283470, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('While you\'re out there getting stones an\' snakes an\' smelly flowers, I\'ll figure out our next move.', '', 283441, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('It\'s good to be back here. Feels like nothing\'s changed. Go on--take it in. Hard to find a place as pretty as Nagrand.\n\nNow, let\'s be \'bout our business.', '', 283425, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('$p, over here!', '', 283422, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ll see ye there.', '', 283421, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Good hunting. Bring back lots of snakes.', 283420, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('As you wish. May your skies be clear and your aim true.', '', 282449, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Very well, I will grant you my sight. Your enemies will appear as targets in the skies.\n\nSpeak with me again if you no longer wish to share in this power.', '', 282446, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The skies darken with the Legion\'s forces. Let us take the fight to them.', '', 282434, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I\'m a very busy person, $n. I do not have time to be everywhere in person. \n\nNow, enough talking. Let\'s begin.', 282068, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Not if you do your job right.\n\nAnd you do always do your job right, don\'t you?', 282066, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I do not want the Oasis to be damaged in case something goes wrong.\n\nHence, we work out here.', 282064, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We can begin when you are ready.', 282061, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'It can\'t be. Is that...', 282008, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1492844544, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The Riftwalker lays wounded in the sands. You may be able to assist.>', '<The Riftwalker lays wounded in the sands. You may be able to assist.>', 281871, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'People love lapbugs. Use this advantage to entice them.', 281530, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Return with pictures of lapbugs in hats. This is a serious matter. Do not disappoint.', 281528, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('K\'aresh restored! There is hope after all.', 'K\'aresh restored! There is hope after all.', 281198, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I had no idea the Oasis was so far along.', 'I had no idea the Oasis was so far along.', 281197, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('There\'ll be lapbugs, right?', 'There\'ll be lapbugs, right?', 281196, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ll go. My partner would love it.', 'I\'ll go. My partner would love it.', 281195, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I didn\'t realize the Oasis had lapbugs. Does that mean lapbugs are coming back?', 'I didn\'t realize the Oasis had lapbugs. Does that mean lapbugs are coming back?', 281185, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Did they say adopt a lapbug? I love lapbugs! Where can I sign up?', 'Did they say adopt a lapbug? I love lapbugs! Where can I sign up?', 281184, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I used to have a lapbug! They are adorable. Let me have a look!', 'I used to have a lapbug! They are adorable. Let me have a look!', 281183, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Is that a lapbug? I haven\'t seen one in... I can\'t even remember how long!', 'Is that a lapbug? I haven\'t seen one in... I can\'t even remember how long!', 281182, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Come to the Oasis and see the native animals of K\'aresh. With your help, K\'aresh can flourish once again!', 'Come to the Oasis and see the native animals of K\'aresh. With your help, K\'aresh can flourish once again!', 281176, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Donate to the Oasis to help their conservation efforts, including lapbug breeding.', 'Donate to the Oasis to help their conservation efforts, including lapbug breeding.', 281175, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You can symbolically adopt a lapbug at the Oasis and receive a card from them.', 'You can symbolically adopt a lapbug at the Oasis and receive a card from them.', 281174, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Marvel at the lapbug\'s cuteness.', 'Marvel at the lapbug\'s cuteness.', 281173, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Gather \'round, everyone!', 'Gather \'round, everyone!', 281172, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('As you can see, not everyone is cut out for this line of work.', '', 280573, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 1498087424, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('We\'ve had an equipment malfunction and misplaced a number of staff in untethered space. Would you go bring our phase divers back to reality?', '', 280572, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 1498021888, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will meet you there with the Worldsoul.', 280395, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1493630976, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'What do you want, $n?', 280393, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Look at us and see yourself, $n. Learn from our mistakes, our trials, our errors.\n \nThere is a long way ahead for my people, but I hope it will give you strength knowing that whatever happens--there is always hope.\n\nI will come to your aid when time comes, that is my... no... our debt to you.\n\nNow go, save your Azeroth.', 280365, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Tell Cartel Zo I pay them to put their lives in danger!', 280336, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('That\'s everything. I\'ll get the necrorays moved to the Oasis. I\'ll let you know when there\'s more to be done.', '', 280261, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Stand still while I decontaminate you.', 280174, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('What a nice lady. It has been wonderful spending time with you, apprentice. Come back soon!', '', 280159, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I will meet you on the other side, $n. Marileth, an unexpected pleasure, as always.', 280158, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Then no, you will not be joining us.', 280156, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I would be delighted to!', '', 280155, 0, 0, 5, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Will you infect everything with a plague?', 280154, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Will I be joining you, wherever you are?', '', 280151, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Hurry this along, $n. \n\nI do not want you to catch something and bring it back with you.', 280140, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('How disappointing.', '', 280121, 0, 0, 274, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'No.', 280120, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Not even a little plague?', '', 280119, 0, 0, 6, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'No. I need them plague-free on arrival.', 280118, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'They\'ve fled the garrisons. But if I know the Shadowguard, they will be back soon enough.', 280003, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1495662592, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Stop Soul-Scribe from destroying the one place K\'aresh can thrive!', 279998, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1493565440, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'That song...', 279978, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1492779008, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Just when I thought that things were getting better, I have been notified of a large scale attack on one of the eco-dome\'s alpha sites. The Wasterlanders, lead by Soul-Scribe, are attacking my domes. There is not much I can do about it at the moment, as my resources have been stretched thin.', 279976, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We are ever in your debt, champion.', 279893, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1496121344, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The Shadowguard have reinforced their position. We must disrupt their forces before they can launch an all-out assault!', 279885, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1496055808, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('These crystals are incredible--maybe even impossible! I can\'t wait to study them further.', '', 279867, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 1497169920, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Certain rare minerals only form at the boundaries between realities. Lucky for us, reality is flexible on K\'aresh.', '', 279866, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 1497104384, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ah, is this my new apprentice? Excellent. We have work to do.', '', 279539, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('My old apprentice! Come--we have work to do.', '', 279538, 0, 0, 3, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I have a contact who will assist you on the other side. Do not disappoint me.', 279533, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'That should hold until the next financial quarter starts. Well done, $n.', 279474, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1495990272, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'That Xy Cartel has lost control of the docks. I need someone competent to sort it out for them.', 279472, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1495924736, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Master Nesingwary. Welcome to K\'aresh. Please find a suitable location. We will talk shortly.', 279166, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Ah, yep, just like Netherstorm. Ye must be Ve\'nari.', '', 279165, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'My name is Ve\'nari. I am looking forward to making your acquaintance.', 279133, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I don\'t often have portals appearin\'. Or talkin\' to me.', '', 279132, 0, 0, 274, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Ah! Yes. Yes, we are ready. Master Nesingwary, please use this portal.', 279130, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('It\'s a tough job, $p, but someone has to do it.', '', 279128, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I\'ll work on getting my things ready while you gather those materials for the tuskarr.', '', 279122, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I am a consummate professional, $n.\n\nI do not make decisions based upon my whims, but for the good of everyone.\n\nNow, go retrieve him for me. I mean us.', 279101, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I do not need to explain myself to you.\n\nSuffice to say, I enjoyed his book. \n\nAll of his books, not just his famous ones.', 279096, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Of course, $n.\n\nI am an information gatherer, and your little rock has a lot of excitement occurring on it.\n\nWhy, I have been tracking you since last we met.', 279093, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Of course, $n.\n\nI am an information gatherer, and your little rock has a lot of excitement occurring on it.', 279092, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Ve\'nari gently picks up and stashes away the soul shard of K\'aresh.', 278986, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So diminished. But not beyond saving.', 278984, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1492975616, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'K\'aresh! The Worldsoul!', 278979, 0, 0, 603, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1492910080, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Those unbound have been haunting these ruins ever since the Devouring. I am glad they are finally at rest.', '', 278863, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1497956352, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Dimensius\' whispers have driven the unbound here mad. Put them out of their misery, so their untethered souls may be free.', '', 278862, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1497890816, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Alright, wee ones! Stick close tae me. Let\'s get ye home.', '', 278816, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Let\'s split up. If ye find the kids, send \'em back here. Don\'t let anything stop ye.', '', 278763, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Excellent. Those weapons are meant to defend against the Wastelanders, not embolden them.', '', 278689, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1497694208, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Wastelanders intercepted a recent shipment of weapons. I need you to steal back the stolen goods.', '', 278688, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1497628672, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Excellent! The eco-domes use a lot of power. If Wastelanders are going to steal our energy, they could at least leave the collecting pylons turned on.', '', 278673, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1497563136, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The Wastelanders drain our pylons of energy. The worst part is they never turn them back on. They need to be activated so our dome is powered.', '', 278672, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1497497600, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Thank you, $n. There isn\'t even an industrial use for the grub guts. They just stain your feet with void ooze.', 278655, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1501888512, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'My eco-domes are constantly under attack. Not by Wastelanders and Shadowguard. Worse! Void grubs. Stomp them out before they pupate.', 278654, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1501822976, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The All-Devouring stirs. We must hurry!', 278601, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1490157568, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'That awful voice. A nightmare I had forgotten.', 278600, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1490092032, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('As Dimensius grows in power, all fates bend toward destruction.', '', 278596, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1490485248, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This--is raw power. Enough to overwhelm and remake untethered souls. It must be stopped.', '', 278594, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 1490288640, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Careful, $n! This garrison\'s conduits have been overloaded with void energy.', '', 278592, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 1490223104, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So you can still defy her after all.', 278591, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1490616320, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Xal\'atath is focused on destruction at all costs. However, I will not abandon my people to the Shadowguard\'s mercies!', '', 278590, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 1490550784, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('A trained mind can withstand the Void. This manaforge untethers the soul, then binds it to Dimensius.', '', 278589, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 1489633280, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Guess I best go get everything ready. Smell ya later, $n.', '', 278474, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Ensure that you find the best concocter of fragrance in your world. I only work with excellence.', 278454, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'You inserted the essences, did you not?\n\nThe world does not revolve around you, $n.', 278442, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I do not make faulty machinery. \n\nI did not intend for you, or anyone, to have to hit a superfluous amount of buttons every time we make a new creature.', 278439, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I am sorry. Was the creation of life from death not enough for you?\n\nPerhaps you want me to conjure a wand that will just fix all your problems if you wave it?', 278436, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Hah! Don\'t be silly, $n. There is a cave roof, it\'s just very high. You can tell. It\'s all dark up there.', '', 278330, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oh you know, getting by. I like these broker fellas. They\'re always up for a good haggle!\n\nAnd that Ve\'nari, woo! I like her. She\'s got spice when she talks. Scent\'s all prickly!', '', 278328, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('How\'re ya doing, $n? Ya need anything? Can I get ya anything? Want to do some trading?', '', 278326, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Hey, can\'t blame a fella for trying, eh? I\'ll find a spot, then we can chat more.', '', 278312, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I believe $n already covered your fee for helping out.', 278311, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Who\'s in charge? Let\'s talk my fee for helping out.', '', 278310, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I... I\'ll miss ya, boss.', '', 278306, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Time to take a last whiff of Mmarl before I head out. I\'ll meet ya there, $n.', '', 278288, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Yes, boss. I\'ll be okay, boss.', '', 278284, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You be okay, Gharrli. Ya hear me?', '', 278283, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Last one\'s special.\n\nBest to get the rest of the mushrooms from you now, in case ya end up dead.', '', 278224, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Sure didn\'t wake up expectin\' to go on an adventure today!', '', 278222, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('You drive a hard bargain!\n\nFifty bug bits, and nine mushrooms. And I\'m cutting my own throat here!', '', 278219, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Wait. Wait!\n\nOk, and I\'m slicing my own pie here. Fifty bug bits, and nine mushrooms?', '', 278216, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Seven? Seven?!\n\nI\'d never be able to show my face in Mmarl again taking a price that low. People would walk past and say \"There goes Rhubarn. I heard he bankrupted himself. Poor Rhubarn--alone, destitute, unloved, and unwanted by kith kind.\"\n\nOne hundred bug bits and mushrooms, in total. Fifty-fifty.', '', 278213, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oh hey now--no need for that. We\'re all friends here!\n\nHow about one hundred bug bits and mushrooms... in total?', '', 278212, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I like your gumption, but I may as well close up my shop I\'d be making such a loss!\n\nI\'d have to let poor Gharrli go. Do you want Gharrli\'s potential children to have their father lose his job?\n\nFive hundred bug bits and mushrooms?', '', 278209, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Just a friendly bit of bartering, traveler. Nothing more!\n\nFive hundred bug bits and mushrooms?', '', 278208, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I have to take into account that my apprentice will take over while I\'m gone, so I have to make sure he\'s well set up... And then taking into account my expenses...\n\n<Rhubarn taps his finders together as though counting.>\n\nAbout one thousand bug bits and mushrooms.', '', 278205, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Oh ho ho! Do ya now buddy?\n\nI can\'t just be whipping up any old scent for ya--I gots to go sniff the merchandise! \n\nAnd if you\'re asking me to leave my shop, that\'s going to cost ya!', '', 278203, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<Rhubarn sniffs the air.>\n\nYer comin\' to me from a long ways away, traveler. What can I do\'s for ya?', '', 278201, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Alleria called for our aid against Dimensius. We will follow her to the end.', 278121, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1488977920, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The wounded Riftwalker gives you a grateful look for healing them.', 'The wounded Riftwalker gives you a grateful look for healing them.', 278119, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'So few allies. The numbers are against us. K\'aresh brings his Testing upon me. \n\nI will find glory.', 278099, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('It is unfortunate how events have unfolded.\n\nI\'m still learning about the k\'areshi and Tazavesh. I must admit I long for home. I still dream of a day when the ren\'dorei can return once more to Quel\'Thalas.', '', 278070, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Come find me and I will reveal the truth. No more secrets.', 277996, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 1477967872, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This camp of the void elves is not defensible. We must attack the Shadowguard now.', '', 277821, 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I have long dreamt of taking back this part of K\'aresh for our people. I am hesitant about partnering with the Void against the Void, but I will take any help we can get.', '', 277819, 0, 0, 1, 256, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', '<Alaenra sighs wistfully and stares off into the distance.>\n\nNot yet.', 277635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Well I thought if I ever get shrunk, it would be great to have a saddle on a bee ready to go.\n\nBesides, he looks quite dapper with it.', 277633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Oh yes! He turned up earlier today. Seems to like being there. \n\nI\'ve taken to calling him Sir Beesington.', 277631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Even fragmented, K\'aresh is worth saving.', 277572, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1496383488, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We can\'t let the devourers infest our home. Cull their numbers before they spread.', 277571, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1496317952, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('I know some complain that removing fragments from their original context invalidates their value. But I like to get things done.', '', 277569, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 1496645632, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('These ruins are filled with the fragments of our lost history. The Trust\'s archeologists can\'t safely excavate, but you can. Retrieve the fragments!', '', 277568, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 1496580096, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'Well done. Nothing upsets the cartels more than slow business.', 277560, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1496907776, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The docks are a quagmire, nothing coming in or out. Help sort it out.', 277559, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1496842240, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Those caravans are vital to the eco-dome operations. The Wastelanders threaten the Trust\'s great mission with their banditry.', '', 277541, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 1496514560, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('The Wastelanders have intercepted another caravan. Recover what you can, and make sure to send a message.', '', 277540, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 1496449024, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The camp has been claimed by void elves. We\'ve heard tales of their victories against the Shadowguard on softer worlds.', 277522, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1487929344, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'We have another ribbon, and an army. All it took was the promise of a better world.', 277515, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1487863808, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'I remember this feeling. The touch of K\'aresh. I wish to carry out my oaths to him.', 277514, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 1487798272, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Will this take long?', 'Will this take long?', 277476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This species has become a foundation species of the Oasis. They are critical to the survival of the ecosystem.', '', 276933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Removing this species from the Oasis would likely have a catastrophic impact. This is not a recommended course of action.', '', 276932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This species is flourishing within the Oasis. Its presence impacts the ecosystem significantly.', '', 276931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This species is now interacting with other species within the Oasis in an ecologically harmonious way.', '', 276930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('This species has started to expand its territory, and is expanding into the rest of the Oasis.\n\nFurther assistance will be required to continue this upward trend.', '', 276926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The Alpha pants heavily. \n\nHe briefly nuzzles you.>', '', 275346, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('<The alpha paws at the ground as you approach, eager to run.>', '', 275261, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The void beckons us onward. Embrace it. Leave your sanity behind.', 274741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 468582400, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('', 'The way forward opens. And your fate entwines with mine.', 274740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 468647936, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796),
('Fluffy licks her paw smugly and then saunters away to safety.', '', 266766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 262144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63796);

