UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text`='Like most others, the Shadowguard attackers paid little to no attention to the rocks and soil within the eco-dome. No soil bags have been damaged, and matter of fact, I hid behind one that I got from a world with the most unusual scented soil I have ever encountered. \n\nYou may be interested to know, I have added three percent more K\'areshi dirt to the soil. It is progressing according to plan with a surprising find--the K\'areshi dirt is binding well... almost too well.\n\nIt reminds me of someone who is emaciated--stuffing their mouth with anything they could for nutrients. Maybe the K\'areshi sand is affected by Dimensius\'s insatiable hunger? Or maybe it\'s something else.\n\n<Om\'tik ponders for a moment.>\n\nNo. That is a silly thought.', `VoiceOverPriorityID`=262144, `EmoteID1`=0, `EmoteID2`=1, `VerifiedBuild`=63796 WHERE `VerifiedBuild`>0 AND `ID`=277009;
